**How to implement.** Implement ExperimentCollectionProxy.createInMemory closing over a ref Map<CollectionName, ExperimentCollectionSnapshot> (the same createInMemory precedent): saveCollection validates the name and upserts; tryLoadCollection and listCollections read the map. Round-trip unit tests over deterministic data: a collection holding a full E1 setup, a sample-less E2, and a dark E3 — with and without DataFilePath attachments — saves, lists, and loads value-identically.

**Acceptance.** After the step, in-memory round-trips preserve ordered setups, optional sample/source shapes including the dark experiment, and DataFilePath attachments — unit-verified.
